--- samtools fastq -
-0 	write reads with neither READ1 nor READ2 to FILE
-1 	write READ1 reads to FILE
-2 	write READ2 reads to FILE
-@ 	number of additional threads to use
-F 	only reads with none of the FLAGs present
-G 	exclude reads with all of the FLAGs present
-N 	always append /1 and /2 to the read name
-O 	use the quality values from OQ tags
-T 	copy arbitrary tags to the header line
-c 	compression level
-f 	only reads with all the FLAGs present
-i 	add Illumina Casava 1.8 format entry to the header
-n 	do not append /1 and /2 to the read name
-o 	write reads with READ1 or READ2 to FILE
-s 	write singleton reads to FILE
-t 	copy RG, BC and QT tags to the header line
-v 	default quality for missing values
--- samtools nosuchsub data/
data/a.bam 
data/b.sam 
data/c.cram 
