--- bgzip -
--binary 	do not align blocks with text lines
-@ 	number of compression threads
-I 	name of the BGZF index file
-b 	decompress at this virtual file pointer
-c 	write to standard output, keep the input files
-d 	decompress
-f 	overwrite files without asking
-g 	use an index file to bgzip a file
-h 	show help
-i 	compress and create a BGZF index
-k 	do not delete the input files
-l 	compression level, from 0 to 9 (-1 for the default)
-o 	write to FILE, keep the input files
-r 	(re)index a compressed file
-s 	decompress N bytes
-t 	test the integrity of a compressed file
--- bgzip -I data/
data/a.bam 
data/a.bam.bai 
data/b.sam 
data/c.cram 
